cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "austraits" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'austraits: Access the AusTraits Plant Trait Database'
version: 4.0.0
doi: 10.1038/s41597-021-01006-6
abstract: An R interface to AusTraits, the Australian plant trait database. `austraits`
  loads releases of AusTraits by version number and maps trait data over Australia.
  The functions to access, explore and wrangle data come from `traits.use`, which
  works on any traits.build relational database; `austraits` re-exports them, so code
  written for earlier versions keeps working.
